rtions; then grep for 'unrunnable' in tools, skills and README and make every remaining mention consistent (keep an old literal only where another test still asserts it and say so in findings). Keep every existing export, flag, command and behaviour; no reformatting of untouched code. Use your shell to read the context files and write your outputs in place; do not run tests, installs or network commands; re-read your files once for syntax before returning.

